A run of multibyte (2-byte) runes with no break, narrow enough to wrap mid-box.
This forces a box split at a multibyte boundary (runeindex's chartorune branch,
frbox.c:96) and canfit's per-rune slow path on a multibyte rune (frutil.c:23) —
paths the C oracle's ASCII fast-path skips for plain text.
-- script --
init 30 100
insert 0 "©©©©©©©©©©©©"
dump
-- output --
frame nbox=6 nchars=12 nlines=6 maxlines=6 lastlinefull=0 modified=1 p0=12 p1=12
  r=(0 0)(30 90) entire=(0 0)(30 100) maxtab=72 fh=15
box[0] run wid=24 nrune=2 "©©"
box[1] run wid=24 nrune=2 "©©"
box[2] run wid=24 nrune=2 "©©"
box[3] run wid=24 nrune=2 "©©"
box[4] run wid=24 nrune=2 "©©"
box[5] run wid=24 nrune=2 "©©"
